    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present an excellent detached family home in the ever popular pocket of D12, No. 123A St Brendans Crescent. This property is bright, spacious and in great condition throughout. The property has a great detached profile and located off the main roads. The stunning property allows a new owner to simply move in and put their own stamp on the home. Accommodation comprises entrance hallway, living room, second reception room and extended kitchen / diner with utility while upstairs on the 2nd floor there are 4 generous sized bedrooms and contemporary family bathroom. On the top floor there is a large attic conversion which could be used as an additional 2 bedrooms,office space or storage. Outside to the rear there is a large sunny garden and is ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. With an enviable location on the ever popular St. Brendans Crescent Road every conceivable amenity is on your doorstep. There are ample recreational facilities in the area with Tymon Park located a short stroll away. Shopping facilities can be found in the nearby Ashleaf & Rathfarnham Shopping Centres and all the amenities of Terenure and Templeogue villages a short drive away. The area is well serviced by frequent and dependable bus routes and the property also enjoys the added bonus of easy access to the M50 motorway network.\n\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
